<br/><!-- hnss:readable-content --><hr/><div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div><p>So, as I was learning some <a href="https://beej.us/guide/bgc/">C</a>, at the pointers/segfault, I was trying this code myself.</p><div><pre tabindex="0"><code data-lang="c"><span><span><span>#include</span> <span>&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span><span>
